# Local FP-product artifacts live on SCRATCH, not in the repo. In particular the
# stray loa0_bal_fp_product.npz that sits in this dir is a LOCAL scratch build and is
# NOT the headline product — the headline loads loa0_fp_product_lyaonly1025.npz from
# SCRATCH (see LOA0_LYAONLY in apply_broadtrough_veto_headline.py). Keep all *.npz
# untracked here so no stray product is ever mistaken for a committed input.
*.npz
loa0_bal_fp_product.npz
